<!--
  Style Star's real pages. Every one of these is a rewrite in netlify.toml
  (status 200) onto the single index.html, so the address is real even though
  the app is one file.

  ⚠️ DELIBERATELY ABSENT, both of them:
  · /results   — it opens the Style Portrait on a device that already has one
                 saved. To a crawler, which has none, it is byte-identical to
                 the home page, so listing it would offer Google a duplicate.
  · /list/*    — a woman's shared wishlist. The token IS the credential, so
                 these must never be advertised. They also carry noindex.

  ⚠️ The canonical host is the APEX, stylestar.app. www 301s to it (verified
  2026-08-24), so every URL here is written without www.
-->
